Package: mcp-server-wakatime
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 nodejs (>= 20),
 node-modelcontextprotocol-sdk,
 node-zod
Description: MCP server exposing WakaTime summaries over stdio
 Model Context Protocol server that proxies the WakaTime Summaries API
 with your API key (WAKATIME_API_KEY) and returns the raw JSON. Provides
 the read-only tools wakatime_summaries and wakatime_today.

Package: mcprack-mcp-server-wakatime
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 mcprack (>= 1.5.4),
 mcp-server-wakatime (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: Registers WakaTime MCP server into mcprack catalog
 Companion package for mcp-server-wakatime. Installing it registers
 the mcp-server-wakatime binary as an available MCP server in the local mcprack
 instance; removing it unregisters it again.
